  "statements": [
    "I2PSessionImpl is abstract; its public constructor cannot be directly instantiated",
    "I2PClientImpl.createSession(context,input,options) constructs package-private concrete I2PSessionMuxedImpl",
    "Muxed constructor calls I2PSessionImpl2, then I2PSessionImpl.readDestination, and creates not-started availability notifier",
    "I2PSessionImpl2 constructor allocates message maps/counters and statistics; connect starts transport later",
    "No connect/send/lookup, router, endpoint, signer or verification change; destroySession(false) remains cleanup only"
